b3d465","layer":"original","quote":"岱寻匡后至〖19〗，徽兄祗，弟幹、颂等六人，肉袒奉迎〖20〗。岱谢〖21〗，令复服〖22〗，前至郡下","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":83,"end":133,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-aedad429ded9dc8488b3","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-50d41da9a9356eb3d465","layer":"original","quote":"而吕岱被诏诛徽，自广州将兵昼夜驰入；过合浦，与良俱前","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q2-6c2fb4046ceff57e7617","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-691db4a39f5154f2e466","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞孙盛曰：“夫柔远能迩，莫善于信；保大定功，莫善于义。故齐桓创基，德彰于柯会；晋文始伯，义显于伐原。故能九合一匡，世主夏盟；令问长世，贻范百王。吕岱师友士匡，使通信誓；徽兄弟肉袒，推心委命。岱因灭之，以要功利；君子是以知孙权之不能远略，而吕氏之祚不延者也。”","attribution":"裴注·孙盛曰","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8a5d77994ee1c7607e32","start":0,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
